ations Sciences Leadership/Social Organizations Student Representation Fraternity and Sorority Life Fraternity Chapters Fraternity Recruitment Sorority Chapters Sorority Recruitment Fraternity and Sorority Life FAQ’s Graduate Student Experience Policies and Regulations Multicultural Opportunities Center for Ethics and Global Studies Office of Diversity Equity and Inclusion Woods Around The World Residential Life Residence Halls and Apartments Residential Requirements Tucker Dining Hall Student Services Academic Success Center Career Services Woods Wellness Center Student Accessibility Resources Faith Services Mail Center Undergraduate Student Experience Lead Award Program Online Student Experience International Student Experience Leadership Opportunities Visit William Woods University One University Ave Fulton, MO 65251 Got Questions? Call us 800.995.3159 Career Services Home » Student Experience » Career Services Welcome to the Office of Career Services The mission of William Woods University’s Office of Career Services is to educate and empower students and alumni in the development of lifelong career strategies for a diverse world. The Office of Career Services provides a wide range of services for students and alumni of the university, including Career Exploration and Planning, Networking Events, Resume and Cover Letter Development, Job and Internship Searches, Graduate School Search Assistance, and Study Abroad Information. Career Services are offered to all William Woods students. Tutoring Schedule (PDF) Career Exploration – Handshake Employers want to meet you– one on one. These employers are joining upcoming virtual events. Set up 1 on 1 time with them to see if you’re a fit for open roles. Download the Handshake App: Apple Store Google Play Networking Opportunities The Office of Career Services provides various opportunities for students to network and connect with potential employers, alumni, and faculty and staff. Contact Career Services The Office of Career Services is located in 205 Aldridge. Email: [email protected] Office Hours: Monday – Friday 9:00 a.m. to 4:00 p.m. Employers Interested in posting jobs or internships for William Woods University students and alumni? Please register and post for free on Handshake. Handshake offers a mobile experience – update your job postings, view applicants, and more all while on the go using Handshake’s responsive design. Join Handshake Internship Opportunities We offer a wide range of internship opportunities tailored to students’ academic interests and career aspirations. These internships provide valuable hands-on experience and networking opportunities. Four – Year Plan and Beyond Our valued Career Services Office is committed to supporting students at every stage of their academic journey, from freshman to senior year and beyond. Our Mission William Woods University promotes a student-centered learning environment valuing inclusion, creativity, and intellectual inquiry. Focused on professions-oriented education, we prepare learners for success. William Woods University One University Ave Fulton, MO 65251 Got Questions? Call us 800.995.3159 Maps & Directions Contact Us Title IX ADA Campus Safety Consumer Information Privacy Policy Social Media Rules Cost & Aid Library Buy your Books Employment Transcripts Project CLEAR Media Relations Site Map Apparel Store Web Request Form William Woods University © 1870- 2026 Submit feedback or report an issue with this website."
